{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Cairn 是一款專注於日子計算的工具，向前倒數你正在等待的日子，向後累計你不願忘記的日子。輸入一個日期，它只回答天數，其餘一切讓路。無論是期待已久的旅程、考試、紀念日，還是戒除習慣的起點，都能一眼看清。原價 US $0.99，現於 App Store 限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>倒數與累計一套模式</h2>\n<p>Cairn 以同一套模式同時處理倒數與累計：向前倒數假期、考試或截止日，向後累計紀念日或戒除習慣的起點。開啟分鐘精確度後可顯示「3 天 4 小時」，最後一小時才出現秒數；事件支援每年、每月或農曆重複，並各自保留所屬時區。內置日期計算器可算出兩日期相距的日數，也能從截圖或文字擷取日期。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-38-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-39-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-40-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-41-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-42-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-43-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Cairn: Countdown &amp; Days Since</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-04T16:58:06.668643+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":353,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}